---
// Mini Preview: modal（模态框）-- 纯静态，零 JS，Gallery/Stream 用
// 居中遮罩对话框，背景内容变暗不可交互
---
<div class="w-full aspect-[16/9] bg-canvas border border-line rounded-card overflow-hidden p-4 relative">
  <!-- 背景内容（变暗） -->
  <div class="absolute inset-4 rounded-control bg-card border border-line p-3 opacity-50">
    <div class="h-2 w-1/3 rounded-full bg-line mb-2"></div>
    <div class="h-full rounded-md bg-tag-bg"></div>
  </div>
  <!-- 遮罩 -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-ink/40 flex items-center justify-center rounded-card">
    <div class="w-3/4 card-surface rounded-control p-4 flex flex-col gap-2 shadow-card">
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
        <div class="h-2 w-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
        <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-tag-bg flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] text-muted">×</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[10px] text-muted leading-snug">确认要删除这个项目吗？此操作无法撤销。</p>
      <div class="flex justify-end gap-2 mt-1">
        <span class="btn btn--ghost rounded-control px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px]">取消</span>
        <span class="btn btn--primary rounded-control px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px]">确认删除</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>